<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Map:_Organic_Chemistry_(Wade)_Complete_and_Semesters_I_and_II/Map:_Organic_Chemistry_(Wade)/10:_Alkynes/10.06:_10.6_Reduction_of_Alkynes" class="mt-section" id="section_6"><span id="Contributors"></span><h3 id="Contributors-110170"><span style="color:#137ac3;"><span style="font-size-adjust:none;"><span style="font-stretch:100%;"><span><span style="orphans:2;"><span style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="white-space:normal;">Contributors</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3>

<ul>
